-- A definition that franchise.l4 imports, and so one that two-hop-rules.l4
-- reaches two imports away: it refuses to answer for a person who is not
-- resident. A file of the agreement corpus with no "agreement:" line is
-- read only by the files that import it.

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is resident` person MEANS
    IF person THEN TRUE
    ELSE REFUSE "non-residents are not modelled"
